        "author": "Sphotography13",
        "license": "CC-BY-SA-4.0",
        "observed": "Viewed warm stone fountain pavilion with four large pointed lower arches,stepped octagonal drum/tall dark lobed fields,small pointed upper niches and ochre dome/stacked finial. Surrounding pointed court arches have small upper spandrel fields and a parapet crest. Minaret ramp/base shape visible behind."
      },
      {
