        "author": "Paul Keller",
        "license": "CC-BY-2.0",
        "observed": "Viewed whole court from minaret:nearly square large pale paved court,single front pointed-arcade rhythm around four sides,small spandrel fields,broad flat pale roofs with deeper prayer range and perimeter crest. Fountain pavilion retains mapped offset;unseen gallery interiors and far tiny roof cap approximated."
      },
